WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.834
Can a satellite see a room

00:00:01.854 --> 00:00:02.925
inside a pyramid?

00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:04.458
Two researchers say yes.

00:00:04.478 --> 00:00:06.371
We're testing that in the open.

00:00:06.391 --> 00:00:08.647
In 2022, Biondi and Malanga

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.167
turned radar traces of tiny

00:00:10.187 --> 00:00:11.804
vibrations into chambers inside

00:00:11.824 --> 00:00:13.218
Khufu's pyramid.

00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:14.649
The journal has since retracted

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:15.876
that paper.

00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:17.501
Separately, in 2025,

00:00:17.521 --> 00:00:18.523
their team claimed eight

00:00:18.543 --> 00:00:20.996
shafts, about 650 meters deep,

00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:22.389
under Khafre's pyramid.

00:00:22.409 --> 00:00:23.527
Nobody has independently

00:00:23.547 --> 00:00:24.778
confirmed them.

00:00:24.798 --> 00:00:26.183
A discovery means predicting

00:00:26.203 --> 00:00:27.379
the place and the depth in

00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:28.760
advance, then confirming it on

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.919
the ground.

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:31.777
So we start with rooms we know.

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:33.100
Two free radar passes,

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.180
weeks apart.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.503
Lock the settings on the King's

00:00:35.523 --> 00:00:36.804
Chamber, then find the others

00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:38.728
blind, among decoys.

00:00:38.748 --> 00:00:40.783
One independent rebuild tried this.

00:00:40.803 --> 00:00:42.362
The Queen's Chamber beat 23 of

00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:43.860
24 decoys on one date,

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.633
but only 6 on the other.

00:00:45.653 --> 00:00:46.701
If known rooms repeat,

00:00:46.721 --> 00:00:48.977
test a deep surveyed tunnel next.

00:00:48.997 --> 00:00:50.405
Pass that, and radar could show

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.631
archaeologists where to look first.

00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:54.152
The data, the code and the test

00:00:54.172 --> 00:00:55.069
are public.

00:00:55.089 --> 00:00:56.966
Link in the description.

